# The Lost Orb (Craig Dutton, v550): full win in 195 commands. Wizard's chamber: legs -> paper -> page (potion needs Firebird feather, fish bone, blue pearl); wear the Amulet of Translation (needed to talk to the sea folk).
# Poster to Laslo, coin from the fountain pays for the fake portrait (10 turns); the fake must NOT be carried north out of Herring Street (guard) so push the tavern table and shove it down the grille, collect it at End of Tunnel, give it to Ramone twice for the brass key.
# Cat -> dog at Crossroads topples DEATH; step on robe for the scythe, cut grass for the iron key, drop the cat in the crypt so the dog digs the bone. Jorek+poster to the museum, open the music box, manhole, refuse, casket (silver key from the oak roots after One-Eyed John flees) -> pearl.
# Zix (knock, brass key, talk, push talons), SAY CHILLIFY then pluck the Firebird; give all three to Altrobus, drink the potion (one shot, all dry-land chores first). Underwater: conch (anemones), firestone (cathedral altar) -> Water Elemental, ebony key -> Princess -> King -> trident -> rocks -> Medusa crystal -> Sea Hag, conch + ride seahorse knocks the plinth, take the Orb.
# Surface, Top of Tower, CALL DRAGON, RIDE RED DRAGON.
